      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The abandoned Eagle Mountain mine near Desert Center was used to film the 1986 comedy Tough Guys and the 1991 movie Terminator 2: Judgment Day.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
        26,
